# The origin the site is served from. Canonical tags, Open Graph URLs, the
# sitemap, and the structured data are all built from it, so it has to match the
# domain in the browser bar. Left unset, src/content/company.js falls back to the
# production origin, which is correct in production and wrong everywhere else.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in. The name has to start with VITE_ or the
# build will not expose it to the client.
VITE_SITE_URL=

# Whether search engines may index the site. Anything but 'true' builds a
# staging copy: robots.txt disallows every crawler, and every page carries
# noindex. Set it to true on the host once the site answers at its own domain,
# alongside VITE_SITE_URL=https://southbeltinc.com.
VITE_SITE_INDEXABLE=
